      "metadata": {
        "comment": "mode 'learner' reads myMessages (the session says whose); 'coach' reads messagesAsCoach for learnerId. stepId narrows a learner's to one homework's thread. tagged shows each message's homework. titleKey and emptyKey are Strings keys ({first} is filled for the coach)."
      }
